  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Green Sustainable and Safe Water Source</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">About twenty systems (GreenSource) for collecting water will be installed to provide twenty villages in rural areas with drinking water. Water will be collected in basins (with artificial grass on top) and be purified. Use of membrane techniques for purification and water will be collected in basis of geotextile. After installation local companies and institutes must have the skills to independently install and maintain more systems.</narrative>
  </description>
